On-Task=
As Inferno slayer tasks are only available after killing Zuk at least once, you should already have some Inferno experience. Although Learner/First cape gear work just as well with a slayer task, higher end gear is highly recommended if looking for fast completions for Slayer experience, Combat achievements, or hunting the pet. With the potent boost from the Slayer helmet (i), you may choose to adjust your setup for more offense. 
* You can get an additional 1/2 on-task attempts per Slayer task with the benefits of the [[Combat Achievements/Master|Master]] and [[Combat Achievements/Grandmaster|Grandmaster combat achievements]].
